                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "As the @HouseGOP celebrates passage of a budget blueprint that will decimate Medicaid, Pell grants, and child food programs, I\u2019m reminded by my Mom\u2019s words to her 7-year-old son after a mischief-filled shopping trip: \u201cyou broke it, you bought it.\u201d",
