                "text": "We\u2019re going to fight to protect Medicaid. We're not going to fidget, fluctuate, or fumble, and we certainly won't fade. We're going to fight to stop Donald Trump and Elon Musk from cutting your healthcare to cover billionaire tax cuts they don\u2019t know how to pay for. https://t.co/a8yWXVxJuu",
