                "text": "From 2007 to 2020, between 42% and 66% of disaster survivors who responded said they were underinsured. CA still hasn\u2019t investigated this epidemic of fraud, suggesting that it\u2019s time to reconsider the state-based models of insurance regulation.  \nhttps://t.co/HQGH5QsKPY",
