                "text": "This is a critical moment\u2014we must stand together to defend the healthcare resources upon which 133,537 of our district\u2019s neighbors depend. The healthcare of 72 million Americans cannot be the sacrificial lamb to provide the wealthiest among us with the windfall of Trump\u2019s $4.5 trillion in tax breaks. Let\u2019s keep fighting\u2014your voices will make the difference.",
