                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "Our hospitals face severe threats from the proposed Medicaid cuts in Congress, and we have to fight to keep them open to continue their life-saving work. Thank you to @StanfordMed and @StanfordChild for hosting our roundtable, and for all they do for hundreds of kids every day! https://t.co/hw6mnGqR2g",
