                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "We met with the California Alliance for Retired Americans to discuss how we're fighting to protect Medicare, Medicaid, and Social Security. These aren\u2019t just programs\u2014they\u2019re lifelines. https://t.co/q99kuEO4CS",
