                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "Sixty years ago today, President Lyndon B. Johnson signed Medicare and Medicaid into law, transforming health care for millions. Republicans just voted to gut this vital set of health supports in the #OBBB. We must strengthen these programs\u2014not tear them down. https://t.co/ndjirEuG8z",
